# Observations assimilated by the coupled analysis: the union of the two single-component
# lists, so the coupled run sees exactly what the separate atmosphere and marine analyses
# see today. Every entry must resolve in exactly one of the two observations/ directories.
#
# To assimilate a different set, point OBS_LIST_YAML at another file rather than editing
# this one, the way the CI cases already do.
observations:
